Package: fpSEM
Type: Package
Title: Fitting Propensity for Structural Equation Models
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-22
Authors@R: person("Dexuan", "Zhao", email = "zhaodexuan@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes and compares fitting propensity (FP) for structural
    equation models. The package makes the conditions of an FP claim explicit:
    fit statistic, threshold, degrees of freedom, data space, convergence
    policy, common draws, and improper-solution rate.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
URL: https://github.com/zhaodexuan/fpSEM
BugReports: https://github.com/zhaodexuan/fpSEM/issues
